OL,3,GNEWSABishop of St Albans installed at
OL,4,Ahistoric service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Right Reverend Andrew Rumsey has
OL,7,Fbeen formally installed as the 11th
OL,8,FBishop of St Albans.
OL,10,FMore than 1,500 people, including local
OL,11,Fdignitaries, attended the ceremony at
OL,12,FSt Albans Cathedral on Saturday, with a
OL,13,Ffurther 4,000 viewers joining the
OL,14,Fservice via a livestream.
OL,16,FIt followed news of his appointment in
OL,17,FMarch, having previously been the
OL,18,FSuffragan Bishop of Ramsbury in the
OL,19,FDiocese of Salisbury.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
