OL,3,GNEWSABishop of St Albans installed at
OL,4,Ahistoric service
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on the personal significance
OL,7,Fof the occasion, the bishop, who grew
OL,8,Fup locally, said it was "a poignant and
OL,9,Fpowerful day for me, marking both a
OL,10,Freturn home and a new beginning".
